{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-07-28 20:23:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, NATIONAL TRIAL LAWYERS, ENCOURAGES WELLS FARGO & COMPANY INVESTORS WITH LOSSES TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - WFC', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JULY 28, 2022) - WHY:\xa0ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY (NYSE: WFC) BETWEEN FEBRUARY 24, 2021 AND JUNE 9, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT AUGUST 29, 2022 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-07-28 14:42:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM REMINDS SHAREHOLDERS WITH LOSSES ON THEIR INVESTMENT IN WELLS FARGO & COMPANY OF CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE - WFC', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JULY 28, 2022) - POMERANTZ LLP ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED AGAINST WELLS FARGO & COMPANY ("WELLS FARGO" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: WFC) AND CERTAIN OF ITS OFFICERS.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-07-28 05:45:00', 'title': 'WFC LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES WELLS FARGO & COMPANY INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JULY 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN WELLS FARGO & COMPANY ("WELLS FARGO" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: WFC) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF WELLS FARGO INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD.'}